Sushi platter of three Tatsugiri lying side by side: the plate bobs gently (driver) and rocks a little, its edges and grass trailing; a beat later each fish wiggles side to side (a wave from head to tail), the three a third of a cycle apart, fins paddling and tail tips trailing most; Curly, reared up at the back, nods with its roe and swings its raised tail.
